OL,3,GNEWSAWoman convicted of murdering baby
OL,4,Adid not get a fair trial - appeal court
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother found guilty of murdering her
OL,7,Fbaby son did not receive a fair trial,
OL,8,Fa Court of Appeal judgement has found.
OL,10,FThe court found there was serious
OL,11,Fexpert witness and prosecutorial
OL,12,Fmisconduct, and poor handling of the
OL,13,F2023 trial by the judge.
OL,15,FThe woman's convictions, for the murder
OL,16,Fof her baby and attempted murder of her
OL,17,Ftoddler, were quashed by the court in
OL,18,F2025 and a retrial was ordered.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
