OL,3,GNEWSAWoman convicted of murdering baby
OL,4,Adid not get a fair trial - appeal court
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this week, the woman, who
OL,7,Fcannot be named for legal reasons, was
OL,8,Fsentenced to 10 years after pleading
OL,9,Fguilty to infanticide and attempted
OL,10,Fmurder.
